# Generated by tools/gen_resources.py on every build; kept tracked on purpose
# (the shipped jar must be reproducible from a clean checkout), so only the
# scratch copies are ignored.
*.orig
*.rej
*.bad
aetherium.json
aetherium.json.bak

# Local benchmark output (tools/benchmark.sh writes here). Do not commit: the
# numbers are machine-specific, and the only published set lives in BENCHMARK.md
# with the hardware named next to it.
benchmark-out/
.jfr/
*.jfr

# Wrapper jar: COMMITTED since 2026-10-10 (the real Gradle 9.4.1 wrapper jar, byte-for-byte
# the one CaffeineMC/sodium ships at the same Gradle), so a clean clone can ./gradlew build
# with no bootstrap step. If a fork ever removes it, run `gradle wrapper` once; the gradlew
# scripts detect the missing jar and say so instead of failing with a stack trace.
